WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Available credit is what matters
Read available and held credit with the ledger. Store credit is scoped
to its store and currency.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Points have program rules
Read earning and redemption history. Points are separate from cash and
may have eligibility or expiry restrictions.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check the card operation
Follow the offered claim or redemption action. A typed code or pending
action does not prove usable credit.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Read the recorded state
Match the invoice, method, currency and amount. Payment attempts,
pending approval and refunds have different states.

